# AiTrainer - Android Intelligent Fitness System

## Overview

AiTrainer is an intelligent fitness system that uses Google's [ML Kit](mdc:https:/developers.google.cn/ml-kit) with BlazePose neural network model to detect human body key points in real-time. The system provides users with:
- Fitness status tracking (movement standards, completion, calories burned)
- Specific fitness programs
- Evaluation of fitness actions

## Key Files and Directories

### Entry Points
- [app/src/main/java/com/lindum/mlkit/vision/MainActivity.kt](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/lindum/mlkit/vision/MainActivity.kt): The main entry point of the application
- [app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml](mdc:app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml): App configuration, permissions, and components

### Core Components
- [app/src/main/java/com/lindum/mlkit/vision/CameraXLivePreviewActivity.kt](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/lindum/mlkit/vision/CameraXLivePreviewActivity.kt): Camera preview activity for pose detection
- [app/src/main/java/com/lindum/mlkit/vision/posedetector/PoseDetectorProcessor.java](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/lindum/mlkit/vision/posedetector/PoseDetectorProcessor.java): ML Kit pose detection processor
- [app/src/main/java/com/lindum/mlkit/vision/posedetector/PoseGraphic.java](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/lindum/mlkit/vision/posedetector/PoseGraphic.java): Visualization of detected poses

### UI Components
- [app/src/main/java/com/lindum/mlkit/vision/fragments/PoseLibraryFragment.kt](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/lindum/mlkit/vision/fragments/PoseLibraryFragment.kt): Pose library fragment
- [app/src/main/java/com/lindum/mlkit/vision/fragments/DiaryFragment.kt](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/lindum/mlkit/vision/fragments/DiaryFragment.kt): Workout diary fragment
